    ],
    "source_code": "/* Подготавливает SQL statement и возвращает opaque sqlite3_stmt handle. */\nvoid *dq_sqlite_prepare(void *db, const char *sql) {\n    sqlite3_stmt *statement = NULL;\n    if (dq_sqlite_prepare_statement((sqlite3 *) db, sql, &statement) != DQ_SQLITE_OK)\n        return NULL;\n    return statement;\n}",
